:question/id #uuid "a77347a8-80b9-5bce-883a-cdfb18cc9a3f" :question/problem "Differentiate $(- 2 x^{2} - 2 x)(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 4).$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we have the product of the two functions $u(x)=- 2 x^{2} - 2 x$ and $v(x)=\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 4.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}((- 2 x^{2} - 2 x)(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 4))^{'} & =u'(x)\\cdot v(x)+u(x)\\cdot v'(x) \\\\ & =(- 2 x^{2} - 2 x)'\\cdot (\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 4)+(- 2 x^{2} - 2 x)\\cdot (\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 4)' \\\\ & =(- 4 x - 2)(\\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + 4)+(- 2 x^{2} - 2 x)(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1) \\\\ & =- 2 x^{2} \\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} - 2 x^{2} - 2 x \\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} - 4 x \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} - 18 x - 2 \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} - 8\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530628 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "46b45ffa-eccb-54d0-a02a-4fbd0b129cee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 x \\sin{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530602} {:answer/id #uuid "d980e549-091a-5015-8b0e-d624b7f03f90" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 x \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + \\left(3 x^{2} - 2\\right) \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530638} {:answer/id #uuid "dca57a40-855e-5d5c-a548-c9e44f1eff72" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 x \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} - \\left(3 x^{2} - 2\\right) \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530639} {:answer/id #uuid "ddf3d812-a10d-5ec4-9438-aaed83e97f48" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left(3 x^{2} - 2\\right) \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530640} {:answer/id #uuid "e90489fd-6700-5f5a-92a2-b8c32b183c48" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 x \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530644}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d980e549-091a-5015-8b0e-d624b7f03f90" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6 x \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + \\left(3 x^{2} - 2\\right) \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530638} :answer-field/id #uuid "642f7201-cb46-5bcf-997b-745a8f3e0236" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530613}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "a9ff3c61-ade3-53cb-bb8e-71f5650e1f69" :question/problem "Differentiate $(3 x^{2} - 2)(\\sin{\\left(x \\right)}).$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we have the product of the two functions $u(x)=3 x^{2} - 2$ and $v(x)=\\sin{\\left(x \\right)}.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}((3 x^{2} - 2)(\\sin{\\left(x \\right)}))^{'} & =u'(x)\\cdot v(x)+u(x)\\cdot v'(x) \\\\ & =(3 x^{2} - 2)'\\cdot (\\sin{\\left(x \\right)})+(3 x^{2} - 2)\\cdot (\\sin{\\left(x \\right)})' \\\\ & =(6 x)(\\sin{\\left(x \\right)})+(3 x^{2} - 2)(\\cos{\\left(x \\right)}) \\\\ & =3 x^{2} \\cos{\\left(x \\right)} + 6 x \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} - 2 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186530641 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e3d46da-e92d-5698-a861-712bac0c6ab4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 4 x \\tan{\\left(x \\right)} + \\left(- 2 x^{2} - 2\\right) \\left(\\tan^{2}{\\left(x \\right)} + 1\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530590} {:answer/id #uuid "3632c38a-4cd9-5c2f-805d-07c3cde69f95" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 4 x \\tan{\\left(x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530595} {:answer/id #uuid "409f7463-ac7f-5d70-951f-2793322a406e" :answer/type {:db/